    {
      "source": "This is the class exposed to handler methods by Spring MVC, typically consumed through\na declaration of the <a href=\"../../ui/Model.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ui\"><code>Model</code></a> interface. There is no need to\nbuild it within user code; a plain <a href=\"../../ui/ModelMap.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ui\"><code>ModelMap</code></a> or even a just\na regular <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> with String keys will be good enough to return a user model.",
      "translation": "这是 Spring MVC 向处理程序方法暴露的类，通常通过声明 `<a href=\"../../ui/Model.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ui\"><code>Model</code></a>` 接口来消费。无需在用户代码中构建它；返回一个用户模型，只需一个普通的 `<a href=\"../../ui/ModelMap.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ui\"><code>ModelMap</code></a>` 甚至只是一个带有 String 键的常规 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>` 就足够了。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
